    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pocket and Zooom",
    "steam_appid": 1453680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stop, turn, and go all out toward the destination! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One collision and the game\u2019s over!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/9784b657e1acfb39870b2e6a1813fc79.avif?t=1750224921\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is Pocket &amp; Zooom?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pocket &amp; Zooom is a puzzle game in which you give commands to aircraft to guide them to their destinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can give only six kinds of commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's more difficult than it sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a strategy to get the aircraft to their destinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to play Pocket &amp; Zooom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Always keep your eye on the airport!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aircraft move steadily towards their destinations, but without your guidance they can easily collide with other aircraft or obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep a close eye on conditions at the airport, quickly find aircraft that are heading into dangerous situations and avoid the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/79ead7430bba18340bfb39737c8b9065.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/79ead7430bba18340bfb39737c8b9065.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/79ead7430bba18340bfb39737c8b9065.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Give commands to the aircraft!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use &quot;command cards&quot; to keep the aircraft away from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the appropriate command from six command cards, including &quot;Stop&quot; and &quot;Change Route,&quot; to guide the aircraft to their destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/7f491105b2fa024fab8078dff59f650e.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/7f491105b2fa024fab8078dff59f650e.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/7f491105b2fa024fab8078dff59f650e.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Be careful not to use too many cards!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After using a card, there is a \u201ccooldown\u201d time during which you have to wait before you can use another card. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about timing when you use a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/5ff026e85040f06d4603a50d43c4df8e.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/5ff026e85040f06d4603a50d43c4df8e.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/5ff026e85040f06d4603a50d43c4df8e.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>[Guide all the aircraft to their destinations!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Safely avoid various dangers and get the aircraft to their destinations to be a hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you only had to guide one aircraft it might be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with each new stage, the number of aircraft increases and the dangers become more frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide all the aircraft to their destinations to clear the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/c6d28dda4ede584dcb1116f8ad00ec6f.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/c6d28dda4ede584dcb1116f8ad00ec6f.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/c6d28dda4ede584dcb1116f8ad00ec6f.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stop, turn, and go all out toward the destination! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One collision and the game\u2019s over!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/9784b657e1acfb39870b2e6a1813fc79.avif?t=1750224921\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is Pocket &amp; Zooom?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pocket &amp; Zooom is a puzzle game in which you give commands to aircraft to guide them to their destinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can give only six kinds of commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's more difficult than it sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a strategy to get the aircraft to their destinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to play Pocket &amp; Zooom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Always keep your eye on the airport!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aircraft move steadily towards their destinations, but without your guidance they can easily collide with other aircraft or obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep a close eye on conditions at the airport, quickly find aircraft that are heading into dangerous situations and avoid the danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/79ead7430bba18340bfb39737c8b9065.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/79ead7430bba18340bfb39737c8b9065.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/79ead7430bba18340bfb39737c8b9065.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Give commands to the aircraft!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use &quot;command cards&quot; to keep the aircraft away from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the appropriate command from six command cards, including &quot;Stop&quot; and &quot;Change Route,&quot; to guide the aircraft to their destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/7f491105b2fa024fab8078dff59f650e.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/7f491105b2fa024fab8078dff59f650e.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/7f491105b2fa024fab8078dff59f650e.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Be careful not to use too many cards!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After using a card, there is a \u201ccooldown\u201d time during which you have to wait before you can use another card. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about timing when you use a card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/5ff026e85040f06d4603a50d43c4df8e.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/5ff026e85040f06d4603a50d43c4df8e.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/5ff026e85040f06d4603a50d43c4df8e.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>[Guide all the aircraft to their destinations!]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Safely avoid various dangers and get the aircraft to their destinations to be a hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you only had to guide one aircraft it might be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But with each new stage, the number of aircraft increases and the dangers become more frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide all the aircraft to their destinations to clear the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/c6d28dda4ede584dcb1116f8ad00ec6f.poster.avif?t=1750224921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/c6d28dda4ede584dcb1116f8ad00ec6f.webm?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453680/extras/c6d28dda4ede584dcb1116f8ad00ec6f.mp4?t=1750224921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
